<details class="how"><summary>How this is estimated</summary><p>Waiting time compares Sheltie's real landing times with a one-at-a-time merge queue simulated from the same ready times: each pull request lands one CI run after the later of its ready time and the previous landing. The CI time is the median measured on the default branch. Author time counts conflicts Sheltie resolved without the author, at the minutes per fix set in <code>[estimates]</code> in <code>.sheltie/merge.toml</code>. <a href="https://sheltie.dev/docs/dashboard.html#time-saved">More</a></p></details><section class="panel activity"><div class="panel-head"><h2>Activity</h2><span class="fine">Landings per day, last 30 days</span></div><svg class="chart" viewBox="0 0 70 48" preserveAspectRatio="none" role="img" aria-label="Landings per day"><defs><linearGradient id="gchart" x1="0" y1="1" x2="0" y2="0"><stop class="stop-a" offset="0"/><stop class="stop-b" offset="1"/></linearGradient></defs><rect class="bar-zero" x="0" y="46" width="7" height="2" rx="1.5"><title>Oct 11: 0 landings</title></rect><rect class="bar" x="10" y="30" width="7" height="18" rx="1.5" fill="url(#gchart)"><title>Oct 12: 2 landings</title></rect><rect class="bar" x="20" y="4" width="7" height="44" rx="1.5" fill="url(#gchart)"><title>Oct 13: 5 landings</title></rect><rect class="bar" x="30" y="39" width="7" height="9" rx="1.5" fill="url(#gchart)"><title>Oct 14: 1 landing</title></rect><rect class="bar-zero" x="40" y="46" width="7" height="2" rx="1.5"><title>Oct 15: 0 landings</title></rect><rect class="bar-zero" x="50" y="46" width="7" height="2" rx="1.5"><title>Oct 16: 0 landings</title></rect><rect class="bar" x="60" y="22" width="7" height="26" rx="1.5" fill="url(#gchart)"><title>Oct 17: 3 landings</title></rect></svg><div class="axis"><span>Sep 18</span><span>Today</span></div>
<div class="now"><div><b>1</b><span>Ready</span></div><div><b>2</b><span>In flight</span></div><div><b>7</b><span>Landed in 24 h</span></div><div><b>1</b><span>Returned in 24 h</span></div></div></section><section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><h2>Queue</h2><span class="count">1</span></div><div class="scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Pull request</th><th>State</th><th>Footprint</th><th>Next</th><th class="r">Updated</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><div class="prcell"><a class="num-chip" href="https://github.com/acme/widgets/pull/7">#7</a><span class="ttl">&lt;img src=x onerror=alert(1)&gt;</span></div></td><td><span class="badge b-blue">Ready</span></td><td><span class="fp"><b>2</b> writes · <b>3</b> affected</span></td><td class="plan">will land now</td><td class="r muted nowrap">just now</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><h2>Recently landed</h2></div><ol class="timeline"><li><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="tl-main"><a class="num-chip" href="https://github.com/acme/widgets/pull/6">#6</a><span class="ttl">Rename rate()</span></div><div class="tl-meta"><a class="sha" href="https://github.com/acme/widgets/commit/aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa">aaaaaaa</a><span class="badge b-green">speculative build</span><span class="badge b-sable">re-derived from its intent (4b)</span><span class="muted nowrap">3 min ago</span></div></li></ol></section>
